TITLE Equilibrium of pure water at pH 7.0 with 10 moles of gypsum

SOLUTION 1
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mol/L
    water     1.0  # kg

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Gypsum    0.0   10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     gypsum_eq.sel
    -reset    false
    -ionic_strength  true
    -pH       true
    -pe       true

END
